      "writtenOn": "2024-11-15T18:35:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We shouldn\u0027t add it directly in the existing limit struct as this one is supposed to match the limit struct of WebGPU. But also can\u0027t we have a new feature that allows any texelCopyBufferRowAlignment, so that we don\u0027t need a feature? We\u0027ll have to fix the BlitToBuffer helper and a few others.",
      "parentUuid": "a7058058_1f9ea795",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1837,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1837,
