      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-16T05:39:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we can support arbitrary alignment. D3D\u0027s compute requires destination address of Write to be multiple of 4. So a new feature would need a new capacities struct where users can query it to know what is the supported CopyBufferRowAlignment by each backend.",
      "parentUuid": "236e31e6_310d67d0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1837,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1837,
        "endChar": 119
      },
      "revId": "b5768306e4575cf7a6e0f7acee6d31826d0a4ab6",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "953170ef_efcdd642",
        "filename": "src/dawn/dawn.json",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1837,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-16T05:42:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Alternatively, we could change BlitTextureToBuffer to support arbitrary alignment. Perhaps using InterlockedOr with existing 4 bytes data for misaligned offset.",
      "parentUuid": "17657687_8314b8e8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1837,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1837,
        "endChar": 119
      },
      "revId": "b5768306e4575cf7a6e0f7acee6d31826d0a4ab6",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "519e7ffe_3e880005",
        "filename": "src/dawn/dawn.json",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1837,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000028
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-18T01:16:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am slightly concerned that using InterlockedOr may incur extra overhead to the compute step in the BlitTextureToBuffer helper. 4 bytes alignment should be able to cover most use cases. It seems good enough for now.",
      "parentUuid": "953170ef_efcdd642",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1837,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1837,
