      "writtenOn": "2024-11-26T19:39:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we have optional features like \"expose native min copy buffer row alignment\" which allows the back ends to override this alignment when enabled?\n\nWould love to avoid the hard-coded 4 bytes in this new feature and allow any backend to expose their real limits.",
