      "message": "@lehoangquyen@chromium.org\nI tried setting the alignment to 1, and some cases triggering BlitTextureToBuffer  ran into failure. It seems to be the restriction of BlitTextureToBuffer, right? Correct me if not the case!",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 268,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 268,
